      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alternatively, we could grab a wake lock around the copy to ensure a consistent snapshot of the wakeup reasons. This is the approach used for dumping suspend_stats. It might also be ok here since wakeup reasons is often only a single string. WDYT?",
